# The design handoff, kept on disk rather than in the repo — a few megabytes of exported HTML that
# nothing builds from and nobody reads twice. `PLAN.md` and `web/README.md` say what it was for.
/Vex modal state design/
/Vex modal state design.zip

# Working notes for whoever changes the code, kept on disk rather than in the repo. Nothing that
# builds or ships reads them; `README.md`, `docs/` and `CONTRIBUTING.md` are what a user needs.
/CLAUDE.md
/PLAN.md

